  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "A zero-waste life is a lifestyle that hardly creates any rubbish.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Zero waste was first suggested by a French woman called B. Johnson.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Her idea is to live a life and try not to create any rubbish.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Use different kinds of ways to save the environment, such as stopping the use of one-off objects, giving unwanted things to others or donating these things to organisations like the Red Cross.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A zero-waste life follows the 6R rule—Refuse, Reduce, Reuse, Repair, Recycle and Rot.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Chen Yuan, 27, is deeply interested in this idea.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "She and her boyfriend Joe have lived in Beijing for many years.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Over August-October when Chen followed the rule of zero waste 6R, she and her boyfriend both produced only two cans of rubbish.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "Now the couple have opened a small shop in Beijing, where they use wood products to take the place of plastic ones and cloth bags printed with environmental logos.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "The store also has second-hand books and CDs to make the best of the used things.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "The zero-waste lifestyle is not for ascetics. It is just around us.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Chen is devoting herself to the zero-waste lifestyle.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "She expects some of her friends to join her on the road to zero waste.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
